commit 32e87ff7d5d3d00a8e9280d203dea7199e04bd83
Author: lora-dataset-studio <noreply@lora-dataset-studio.dev>
Date:   Mon Aug 24 12:28:04 2026 +0200

    feat(gallery): the 🖼 Gallery page — every generated image, one feed
    
    A sixth workspace: everything the app ever rendered (Test Studio cells,
    canvas previews, comparison runs, ✨ improvements) across every dataset,
    newest first, cursor-paged, filterable (dataset / renders / improved /
    liked). Built for the phone as much as the desktop: 2→6 grid columns,
    finger-sized controls, and the shared viewer gains OPTIONAL ‹ › browsing
    (buttons + arrow keys) that the three existing hosts do not mount.
    
    The verbs are the ones the other galleries already ship, reused: the ONE
    improve handler (with this feed's own toast address), the checkpoint
    panel's Select/delete guard rails, the lineage-named download and the
    selection ZIP through the same URL builder, widened by an app scope.
    
    Contract tests pin the addresses, the opt-in chevrons (in the DOM), the
    nav gate and the probe markers.
